      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture. The test file has many unused data provider methods and a single long chained method call crammed onto one line. I'll improve understandability by:\n1. Removing all unused data provider methods and imports\n2. Breaking the `EqualsTester` chain into one group per line with explanatory commentsThe improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes all unused data provider methods and imports, and breaks the long `EqualsTester` chain into clearly commented individual equality groups — one per line — making it immediately obvious what each group represents (baseline date, different day, different month, different year, boundary days, leap year case, etc.)."
